# ==============================================================================
# READYSETJOB FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# ---- 1. Backend REST API Base URL ----
# Development: Vite proxies /api to the backend, so localhost works.
# Split deploy: set to the BACKEND service public URL, e.g.
# VITE_API_URL=https://jobreadiness-be.up.railway.app/api
# If empty, the app calls the same origin (/api) - fine for single-instance deploys.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

# ---- 2. Text-to-Speech (Lifelike Voice Interviewer) ----
# The ElevenLabs key is a SECRET and must never be placed in frontend code or a
# VITE_ variable (VITE_ values are bundled into public JS). The browser calls the
# backend proxy `/api/tts/speak`; configure ELEVENLABS_API_KEY on the BACKEND only.
# If the backend key is absent, the app falls back to the browser Web Speech API.

# ---- 3. HeyGen Streaming Avatar (optional, backend-authoritative) ----
# The AI interviewer avatar/voice are resolved SERVER-SIDE from the backend's
# HEYGEN_AVATAR_ID / HEYGEN_VOICE_ID (and the short-lived token from
# POST /api/interview/avatar/token). The HEYGEN_API_KEY must NEVER be a VITE_ var.
# The variables below are optional display overrides only; when unset the backend
# values win. Do not put provider secrets here.
# VITE_HEYGEN_AVATAR_ID=
# VITE_HEYGEN_VOICE_ID=
